During the Professor's attempt to summon [[Overlos]], the Titan of Immortality, Eathon was left to summon his two Undergolem Titans in order to keep the Huntik team occupied. After finally defeating the Titans, Dante called him by name to stop him from warning the Professor. {{source|The Mission}}

Eathon led [[Hoffman]] to the Chu-Goku mount where he found the hidden [[Amulet]] of [[Divine Mirror Kagami]]. {{Source|Knight of the Willblade}}

When [[Grier]] helped the Huntik team to access the castle in order to find the Professor's files on [[Rassimov]], Eathon the dog summoned his two Undergolem Titans again to stop them. {{Source|An Ally from the Organization}}

